# OmniOS ISO package set.
#
# Only packages that exist in the official Arch repositories can appear here:
# mkarchiso installs with pacman, which has no idea what the AUR is. The AUR
# half of Phase 8 (shadPS4, Ryubing, Azahar, DuckStation, Waydroid, Heroic) is
# in packages.aur.txt and installed by omni-first-boot on the running system.

## Base system — Phase 1
base
base-devel
linux-firmware
sudo
git
curl
wget
vim
nano

## Kernel — Phase 1.2. This is the whole point of the profile: the gaming
## kernel is a property of the image, not an archinstall menu choice.
## BORE scheduler, futex2/fsync for Proton, CONFIG_HZ=1000 (OmniOS.md §16).
linux-zen
linux-zen-headers

## Live medium plumbing. mkinitcpio-archiso provides the hooks the preset in
## airootfs/etc/mkinitcpio.d/linux-zen.preset asks for.
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
syslinux
edk2-shell
memtest86+
memtest86+-efi
arch-install-scripts
archinstall
squashfs-tools
dosfstools
e2fsprogs
btrfs-progs
exfatprogs
ntfs-3g

## GPU — Phase 2.1. All three vendors ship on the image; the right one binds at
## boot. lib32 variants are required by Proton and every 32-bit Windows title.
mesa
lib32-mesa
vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-vulkan-icd-loader
vulkan-radeon
lib32-vulkan-radeon
vulkan-intel
lib32-vulkan-intel
vulkan-mesa-layers
lib32-vulkan-mesa-layers
libva-mesa-driver
mesa-utils
vulkan-tools

## Audio — Phase 2.2. PipeWire at 3-5 ms (OmniOS.md §16).
pipewire
lib32-pipewire
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-jack
lib32-pipewire-jack
wireplumber

## Networking — Phase 2.3
networkmanager
iwd
openssh

## Storage and input — Phases 2.4, 2.5
udisks2
udiskie
libinput
usbutils
psmisc

## Display — Phase 3. Hyprland is the phase-1 compositor; the custom wlroots
## shell replaces it later without changing anything else in this profile.
hyprland
xorg-xwayland
qt6-wayland
seatd
polkit
# Terminal emulator: the launcher's escape hatch, and the surface the
# placeholder launcher draws into until the QML shell exists.
# foot-terminfo is only an optional dependency of foot, so it has to be named
# explicitly. Without it TERM=foot falls back to whatever ncurses ships, and
# screen control the launcher relies on (clear, cursor addressing) degrades.
foot
foot-terminfo

## Core gaming services — Phase 4
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
cpupower
zram-generator

## Compatibility layers available in the official repos — Phase 8.
## Steam brings Proton; the rest of the tier-3 emulators are packaged in extra.
steam
wine
wine-mono
wine-gecko
winetricks
vkd3d
lib32-vkd3d
dolphin-emu
retroarch
retroarch-assets-ozone
libretro-core-info

## Launcher toolchain — Phase 10. Qt6 + QML, and the compiler the core needs.
qt6-base
qt6-declarative
qt6-svg
cmake
ninja
gcc

## Branding — Phase 11
plymouth
ttf-dejavu
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji

## Controllers. multilib ships no lib32 SDL2 of any kind; lib32-sdl3 is the
## only 32-bit SDL there, and sdl2-compat serves the SDL2 API on top of SDL3.
## game-devices-udev is AUR-only and lives in packages.aur.txt.
sdl2-compat
sdl3
lib32-sdl3
